{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Pinhead Adventures is the story of how time ends.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/extras/cc987af382010b34cfdf7ba2b54177b8.webp?t=1772580703\" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Zortan has killed everything in the universe, tracking down his final target: The Pinhead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/extras/1c22ca8cdd88c963c8c0982f9df9461f.poster.avif?t=1772580703\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/extras/1c22ca8cdd88c963c8c0982f9df9461f.webm?t=1772580703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/extras/1c22ca8cdd88c963c8c0982f9df9461f.mp4?t=1772580703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore 5 Levels filled with Action, Puzzles, and Secrets to lure Zortan Back to the Solar System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/extras/15533a4c3e75210633573d11a85dff67.poster.avif?t=1772580703\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882840/extras/155